#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "384_Sodachi"
msgid "Congratulations, Watanabe-kun! Happy birthday!"
msgstr "¡Felicidades, Watanabe-kun! ¡Feliz cumpleaños!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "396_Sugiyama"
msgid "It's not his birthday. We're celebrating his victory."
msgstr "No es su cumpleaños. Estamos celebrando su victoria."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "408_Sodachi"
msgid "Oh, come on! I know that! It was just a little joke!"
msgstr "¡Oh, vamos! ¡Ya lo sé! ¡Solo fue una bromita!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "420_Sodachi"
msgid "It was funny, right? Heheheh..."
msgstr "Fue graciosa, ¿verdad? Jejejeje..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "432_Sugiyama"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "444_Watanabe"
msgid "Saejima-sensei, thank you so much. I used to be nothing more than a fat kid, but now I'm a strong and agile fighter. I never would've thought it was possible."
msgstr "Saejima-sensei, muchas gracias. Antes no era más que un niño gordo, pero ahora soy un luchador fuerte y ágil. Nunca pensé que esto fuera posible."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "456_Saejima"
msgid "Ya look down on yerself too much. You weren't ever just some \"fat kid.\" Ya always had the potential."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "468_Saejima"
msgid "You just kept puttin' others first and holdin' yerself back. Ya just never realized it before, that's all."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "480_Watanabe"
msgid "You're right... I'm not just a fatty anymore, I'm a champion now!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "492_Saejima"
msgid "Ya got that right. Be proud of yerself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "504_Saejima"
msgid "Bein' kind to others is important, but you gotta learn how to give yerself a break, too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "516_Watanabe"
msgid "Right!"
msgstr "¡Voy!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "540_Watanabe"
msgid "Tokita-san... I have a favor to ask you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "552_Tokita"
msgid "Hm? What is it?"
msgstr "¿Qué? ¿Qué es esto?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "564_Watanabe"
msgid "Fight me!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "576_Tokita"
msgid "What!?"
msgstr "¡¿Qué?!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "588_Watanabe"
msgid "I used to be afraid of people hating me. I didn't wanna get hurt. That's why I always held back my own feelings."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "600_Watanabe"
msgid "But... that was a mistake. I realized that when you got mad at me, Tokita-san."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "612_Watanabe"
msgid "What I'd been doing wasn't \"kindness.\" It was just a way for me to escape reality."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "624_Watanabe"
msgid "But I'm not running anymore. I am going to face people head-on, no matter how much I get hurt and no matter how much people end up hating me."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "636_Watanabe"
msgid "I'm a new man. And I want to prove that to you in a sparring match!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "648_Watanabe"
msgid "Please, Tokita-san, fight me once more!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "660_Tokita"
msgid "Why are you getting so worked up? You're such an idiot."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "672_Watanabe"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "684_Tokita"
msgid "But... I like that attitude."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "696_Watanabe"
msgid "...!"
msgstr "¡...!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "708_Tokita"
msgid "Heheh. Let's see which of us is the stronger fighter. Show me how much you've really changed!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "720_Watanabe"
msgid "Right! My pleasure! Here goes!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "744_Sodachi"
msgid "What a beautiful sight. Apprentices teaching each other and helping each other grow."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "756_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah. Seems like I ain't got nothin' else I can teach now."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "768_Sodachi"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "780_Saejima"
msgid "This place has become an amazin' dojo."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "852_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank has increased."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "888_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank increased! Now more apprentices are sure to join, and the money will start flowing! Heheheh!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "900_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "972_Sodachi"
msgid "The dojo's rank decreased! This is a nightmare... Ugh, my chest hurts... The stress is killing me! Saejima-san! Do something!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "984_Saejima"
msgid "(Will he pipe down already...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1056_Watanabe"
msgid "I lost... I'm so embarrassed. I guess I'll never be able to change..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1068_Sodachi"
msgid "It's too bad about the loss. Seems like Watanabe-kun is pretty broken up about the whole thing, too. I feel kind of guilty..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1080_Sodachi"
msgid "But don't worry. Everyone loses sometimes. What's important is that you pick yourself up and try again. Let's help him win next time!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1188_Sodachi"
msgid "You did it! That was a spectacular win! It looks like this experience has made Watanabe-kun an even stronger fighter. Are you more confident now?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1200_Watanabe"
msgid "Yeah, but just a little. This is all thanks to you guys. I'll keep up the hard work."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1212_Sodachi"
msgid "Don't forget, we got the prize money, too! Heheh! Keep up the hard work and we'll be rich－ I mean, champions! Ha! Yeah, champions!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1332_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Dragon's Gate.\tThis is a match for beginning fighters. The level of entry isn't high, so it's perfect for practice."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1344_Sodachi"
msgid "This is the beginning of all history. Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "1356_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in a Brawlfest. This is a match for hot-blooded street fighters. I think he should do all right..."
msgstr "Competirás en un Peleatón. Este es un combate para peleadores callejeros aguerridos. Creo que le irá bien..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1368_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighting connoisseurs! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1380_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Regular Tryouts. This is a match held regularly at the Coliseum for mid-level fighters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1392_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, time's a-wasting! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1404_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Shuffle Zone. The skill levels of the fighters in this match are unknown."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1416_Sodachi"
msgid "I hope your opponent isn't too strong... Wow, my heart is racing! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1428_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Big Money match. The prize purse for winning this match is incredible! Money! MONEY! Heheheh!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1440_Sodachi"
msgid "All right, let's go! Go Sodachi Dojo! Go get me that money!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1452_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Rising Stars. This is a famous event where young fighters with great potential gather to prove themselves. A true first step."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1464_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, time's a-wasting! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1476_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Sink or Swim match. This is an event for fighters who are just getting started. Let your skills speak for you."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1488_Sodachi"
msgid "Believe in your own abilities! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1500_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Winner's Circle. This is an event for undefeated fighters. Be ready for some strong competition."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1512_Sodachi"
msgid "You won't be able to compete again if you lose, so make sure to win! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1524_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Veteran's Showdown. This is an event for fighters with a long training history."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1536_Sodachi"
msgid "It's time to put what you've learned to the test and show 'em who we are! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1548_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in the Coliseum Opening Fight.\\r\nIt's an extremely high-profile match that is, you guessed it, the opening event at the Coliseum!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1560_Sodachi"
msgid "This kind of attention-grabbing fight attracts some pretty strong fighters, but that's no reason for you to lose! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1572_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in King of the Mountain. This is a very high-level match for skilled fighters who have what it takes to be champion."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1584_Sodachi"
msgid "Brush up your own skills by fighting stronger opponents. Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1596_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Power Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1608_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighters proud of their power gather at this event, so the fights are sure to be intense. Give it your all, super Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1620_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Speed Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1632_Sodachi"
msgid "Fighters proud of their level of speed gather at this event. You're perfect for this one! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1644_Sodachi"
msgid "You will be competing in Technique Masters."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1656_Sodachi"
msgid "Only fighters with superior technique fight in this event, so stay focused! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1668_Sodachi"
msgid "ou will be competing in Rookie Stars. As the name suggests, this is a match for rookie fighters aiming to be number one."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1680_Sodachi"
msgid "This is the highest level match, so make sure you're ready. Go Sodachi Dojo, the strongest dojo in Kamurocho!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1704_Watanabe"
msgid "I lost... I'm so embarrassed. I guess I'll never be able to change..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1716_Sodachi"
msgid "It's too bad about the loss. Seems like Watanabe-kun is pretty broken up about the whole thing, too. I feel kind of guilty..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1728_Sodachi"
msgid "But don't worry. Everyone loses sometimes. What's important is that you pick yourself up and try again. Let's help him win next time!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1848_Sodachi"
msgid "Now it's time to participate in a tournament. Watanabe-kun, you can do it. Just be confident in yourself."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1860_Saejima"
msgid "He's right. You can do this. You can change. You ain't just some fat kid, okay?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1872_Watanabe"
msgid "...Yes. Saejima-san, Sodachi-san. I'll give it my best!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1884_Sodachi"
msgid "Well, Saejima-san, here goes your last apprentice! Now, on the count of three. One, two, three! Go Sodachi Dojo!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1920_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow, you really are an amazing fighter, Saejima-san! I bet you learned a lot from the experience too, didn't you, Watanabe-kun?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1932_Watanabe"
msgid "Dang, that hurt! Saejima-san, you're really strong. I hope that I can be like you one day..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "1944_Saejima"
msgid "Heheh. There ain't no question about it. Let's do it again sometime. I'll be lookin' forward to it."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2028_Sodachi"
msgid "Sparring or not, I can't believe he beat you! You were amazing, Watanabe-kun! I bet you're more confident in yourself now, right?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2040_Watanabe"
msgid "How am I supposed to feel more confident when Saejima-san just lets me win like that!? I'm actually shocked that you would take me for such a chump."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2052_Sodachi"
msgid "Ugh... No, no! We thought that it would make you more confident. Make sure you fight him at full strength next time, Saejima-san!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2136_Sodachi"
msgid "It's time for some sparring. Saejima-san, use those fists of yours to bring out his talent and confidence!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2148_Saejima"
msgid "Right. There ain't no use in doin' this unless I go all out. Same goes for you, Watanabe. Ya got it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2160_Watanabe"
msgid "Got it! I'll come at you with everything I have!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2184_Sodachi"
msgid "You want him to try solo training? This means that you trust your apprentice. Plus you can sit back and watch! Nothing beats that!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2196_Saejima"
msgid "That ain't the point... Anyway, you can choose yer own trainin' routine. Just don't go slackin' off."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2208_Watanabe"
msgid "I understand. I'll do my best!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2268_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2280_Watanabe"
msgid "It was great! And it's all thanks to you, Saejima-san!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2292_Saejima"
msgid "(Looks like it went well. Great job.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2328_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2340_Watanabe"
msgid "It went okay, I guess. I have a feeling that it could have gone better, though. I'll just have to work harder next time!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2352_Saejima"
msgid "(Not too bad. I guess...)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2388_Saejima"
msgid "How was it? Ya learn anythin'?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2400_Watanabe"
msgid "Huh? Ugh... It went okay... I guess... Heheh."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2412_Saejima"
msgid "(He's lyin'. Guess it didn't go well.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2520_Saejima"
msgid "How's about we rest this time? Rest is important too."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2532_Sodachi"
msgid "Yay! That's a wonderful idea! Let's rest away!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2616_Watanabe"
msgid "Zzz..."
msgstr "Zzz..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2628_Sodachi"
msgid "*snores* Gaaaa... Gaaaa... *snores* Mmmm..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2664_Sodachi"
msgid "Googa googa... *snores* Nyaar... *snores*\\r\nHeheh, but I can't eat anymore... *snores*"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2676_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2748_Sodachi"
msgid "Wow! I feel so refreshed! Resting really is necessary sometimes."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2856_Saejima"
msgid "All right. This time I'm gonna teach ya a potential Finishing Move."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2868_Saejima"
msgid "(Which move should I teach 'im?)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2904_Saejima"
msgid "Okay, let's get started."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "2916_Saejima"
msgid "Let's work on the move you ain't mastered yet. Okay, let's get started."
msgstr "Vamos a enfocarnos en el movimiento que aún no has dominado. Bien, empecemos."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "2988_Saejima"
msgid "...So, that's it. Think ya got it?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3000_Watanabe"
msgid "Well, honestly, it's a bit hard. I think I can learn it if I have some more time, though."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3012_Saejima"
msgid "(...He couldn't learn it after one try. But he'll get it next time.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3084_Saejima"
msgid "I'm sure ya got it down now. Give it a try."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3096_Sodachi"
msgid "Go easy on me, please."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3108_Sodachi"
msgid "Aaaaagh!"
msgstr "¡Aaaaagh!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3132_Saejima"
msgid "Good! You did it just right that time. Now don't forget what ya learned."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3156_Sodachi"
msgid "He learned <Color:9>Tiger Slam<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3168_Sodachi"
msgid "He learned <Color:9>Tiger Suplex SP<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3180_Sodachi"
msgid "He learned <Color:9>Tiger Throw<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3192_Sodachi"
msgid "He learned <Color:9>Tiger Flying Knee<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3204_Sodachi"
msgid "He learned <Color:9>Essence of Smashing<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
