#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3372_Sodachi"
msgid "Welcome back. Did you guys have fun? *sniffle* I wish I could go, too... I've been waiting for so long..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3396_Sodachi"
msgid "All right, see you next time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3480_Saejima"
msgid "How's about we call it quits for today n' go out for a drink?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3492_Sodachi"
msgid "That sounds great! You have to know how to separate work and play, right? Wait..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3504_Saejima"
msgid "See ya later."
msgstr "Nos vemos."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3516_Sodachi"
msgid "Okay! Bring me a souvenir from the bar!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3528_Sodachi"
msgid "Guess I'll clean up or something..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3600_Sodachi"
msgid "Hmmm..."
msgstr "Mmmm..."

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3612_Saejima"
msgid "Somethin' wrong?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3624_Sodachi"
msgid "Well... It's just that lately Watanabe-kun seems down for some reason."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3636_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3648_Sodachi"
msgid "We've been pushing him in training for a long time now, so if he doesn't win a tournament soon he may just give up on us."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3720_Sodachi"
msgid "Watanabe-kun lost..."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3732_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah... Where is he right now?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3744_Sodachi"
msgid "Now that you mention it, he hasn't come back to the dojo at all. I guess the loss was a shock."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3756_Sodachi"
msgid "I'll go and look for him!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3768_Saejima"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3828_Sodachi"
msgid "*pant* Here he is!"
msgstr "*jadeo* ¡Aquí está!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3840_Watanabe"
msgid "I'm sorry... I made you all worry..."
msgstr "Lo siento... Hice que se preocuparan..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3852_Sodachi"
msgid "You had us worried sick!"
msgstr "¡Nos tenías muy preocupados!"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3864_Watanabe"
msgid "It's just that you guys worked so hard to train me, and I still couldn't win."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3876_Watanabe"
msgid "I have no chance of winning. And I'll never be a strong fighter."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3888_Sodachi"
msgid "That's not true, Watanabe-kun. If you quit now, everything will have been for nothing. How about giving it just one more try, huh?"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3900_Watanabe"
msgid "I guess... I'll give it a try. I don't think that anything will change, though."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "3912_Saejima"
msgid "(I'm glad he's back, but it looks like he's lost a lot o' motivation. Better get him that champion belt, and quick.)"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "3996_Sodachi"
msgid "Hey, Saejima! I was waiting for you! Shall we start our training now?"
msgstr "¡Ey, Saejima! ¡Te estaba esperando! ¿Le damos al entrenamiento de una vez?"

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4008_Saejima"
msgid "Yeah, let's get started."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4020_Sodachi"
msgid "All right! Here's to another day of training! Let's get to work!"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4044_Saejima"
msgid "Maybe later."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4056_Sodachi"
msgid "Oh, that's too bad. But you are a pretty busy person. Come back when you have more time."
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=todo
msgctxt "4068_Sodachi"
msgid "Start Training"
msgstr ""

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "4080_Sodachi"
msgid "Not Now"
msgstr "Ahora no"

